#: scenario5:scenario5_93B6E9D6_C9ED_40CF_A240_4EF6D799D9D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 271cfec5d0c314f81bd51ce10122078bb1dab57527083f80fe2ca598f7067cd3
